WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.670 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.920 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

01:55.090 --> 01:56.970
Sakie-chan...

01:56.970 --> 01:58.590
Yes...?

01:58.590 --> 02:01.550
Will you marry me?

02:01.550 --> 02:02.180
Yes!

02:15.690 --> 02:19.570
Hmph, what's with this marriage crap?

02:19.570 --> 02:23.240
How dare those impertinent humans want to become happy.

02:23.240 --> 02:25.540
You seem to be slightly vexed.

02:25.540 --> 02:27.410
That's none of your business.

02:27.410 --> 02:32.090
What are you doing, being all lovey-dovey with Jeanne, anyway?

02:32.090 --> 02:34.250
That's my plan.

02:34.250 --> 02:35.250
Plan?

02:35.250 --> 02:37.220
The real scenario is about to start.

02:37.220 --> 02:40.180
It's about time I eliminate any hindrances.

02:40.180 --> 02:46.430
Hmm. I don't know what you're planning, but you had better not get in my way.

02:49.850 --> 02:52.650
The power of God that protects her...

02:52.650 --> 02:55.150
If I weaken her heart...

03:00.910 --> 03:05.410
Sinbad the Liar!!

03:06.160 --> 03:08.870
All right, everyone, calm down.

03:08.870 --> 03:15.880
Through Shikaido-sensei's connections, we are going to clean up this church as part of a volunteer community service.

03:15.880 --> 03:18.210
Everyone, it's nice to meet you all.

03:18.210 --> 03:20.590
Nice to meet you!!!

03:20.590 --> 03:24.470
This is the first time I've visited a church! I'm so excited!

03:24.470 --> 03:28.600
Well, you and I will be paying a visit here in the near future, so let's take a good look around.

03:28.600 --> 03:32.020
Aha! You two are <i>that</i> close now... Memo! Memo!

03:32.020 --> 03:34.270
No way! With who...?!

03:34.270 --> 03:39.360
We are visiting this historic monument as part of the World History class!

03:39.360 --> 03:41.650
Stop fooling around and get serious!

03:41.650 --> 03:42.740
Yes, ma'am.

03:42.740 --> 03:45.280
Now, let's begin. Come this way.

03:45.280 --> 03:46.530
Stop!

03:47.790 --> 03:50.000
Men, go this way.

03:50.000 --> 03:52.830
T-This is a double standard...

03:52.830 --> 03:55.000
Work hard!

04:08.180 --> 04:11.640
Wow! It looks like I've wandered back into the Middle Ages!

04:11.640 --> 04:16.810
The design of this church is a replica of those from the Middle Ages.

04:16.810 --> 04:21.150
I bet it would be so wonderful to hold a wedding ceremony here.

04:21.150 --> 04:22.070
That's true...

04:22.070 --> 04:25.110
It makes me want to get married right now!

04:25.110 --> 04:26.570
And your partner would be...?

04:26.570 --> 04:28.620
That's the problem...

04:29.240 --> 04:31.830
"Kusakabe-san, will you marry me?"

04:31.830 --> 04:33.620
"Yes, I will!"

04:33.620 --> 04:35.460
Now, let's start cleaning...

04:35.460 --> 04:38.130
What does that mean?!

05:06.530 --> 05:09.330
What are you doing! Geez, stop acting like a kid!

05:09.330 --> 05:13.960
S-Sorry! But this thing is pretty amazing.

05:15.000 --> 05:17.630
Yeah, it's pretty old.

05:17.630 --> 05:25.010
The pipe organ was brought here from a famous church, and it has a little legend to go with it.

05:25.010 --> 05:26.380
Legend?

05:26.380 --> 05:32.430
Whoever is married while this pipe organ is playing will be happy forever.

05:33.350 --> 05:34.640
Is that true?!

05:34.640 --> 05:39.230
When you find a person you can rely on and trust from the bottom of your heart, come here any time you wish.

05:39.230 --> 05:42.070
God will surely bless the both of you.

05:42.070 --> 05:43.400
Yes! I will do my best!

05:43.400 --> 05:44.650
Do your best?

05:44.650 --> 05:47.820
Huh? What Maron? You want to take out the trash?

05:47.820 --> 05:51.370
I'll take it from here. You go right on ahead!

05:51.370 --> 05:52.700
W-What the heck?!

05:52.700 --> 05:56.870
I'm going to clean you up, so give me happiness!

05:56.870 --> 05:59.750
Isn't there something wrong with this picture?

06:01.040 --> 06:03.840
Hmm, happiness, huh?

06:05.010 --> 06:10.510
Then, instead of God's blessing, why not a Demon's blessing?

06:10.510 --> 06:14.810
Jeanne will never be happy!

06:27.400 --> 06:29.660
Sister, are you all right?

06:33.200 --> 06:34.740
There's nothing wrong.

06:40.670 --> 06:43.790
<i>A person I can rely on and trust from the bottom of my heart...</i>

06:44.710 --> 06:46.670
Kusakabe-san.

06:46.670 --> 06:48.380
Hijiri-sensei.

06:48.380 --> 06:50.510
What are you doing here?

06:50.510 --> 06:52.970
Oh, um, I...

06:53.470 --> 06:57.100
It's a bad habit. Were you lost in thought?

06:57.100 --> 06:59.350
Y-Yes...

06:59.890 --> 07:03.310
I see. A person you can rely on and trust from the bottom of your heart.

07:03.310 --> 07:05.940
Do you have a person like that?

07:05.940 --> 07:07.610
Don't you have one, Kusakabe-san?

07:07.610 --> 07:09.150
Well...

07:10.070 --> 07:12.780
I used to have a girlfriend...

07:12.780 --> 07:16.950
We are apart now, for certain reasons...

07:16.950 --> 07:20.580
I believe in her from the bottom of my heart.

07:22.080 --> 07:24.960
Don't you have Nagoya-kun?

07:24.960 --> 07:27.210
How do you feel about him?

07:27.210 --> 07:29.300
Umm, well...

07:29.300 --> 07:32.890
I love him! B-But...

07:32.890 --> 07:33.800
But?

07:33.800 --> 07:37.430
I don't know how he feels about me...

07:40.520 --> 07:41.890
Sensei!

07:44.900 --> 07:46.690
Huh? Where's Maron?

07:46.690 --> 07:48.480
Happiness, huh?

07:48.480 --> 07:49.150
H-Hey!

07:49.150 --> 07:50.950
She's taking out the trash. Did you need her?

07:50.950 --> 07:51.950
O-Oh, no. Um...

07:51.950 --> 07:55.450
Chiaki, if you make Maron miserable, I'll never forgive you!

07:55.450 --> 07:56.160
Huh?

07:56.160 --> 07:59.290
You guys are so lucky...

07:59.290 --> 08:02.290
I-I'm going to go check up on her.

08:04.040 --> 08:08.960
I see, so you can't believe Nagoya-kun's words lately.

08:08.960 --> 08:10.590
Yes...

08:10.590 --> 08:14.890
So that's what's been bothering you. It's just like Nagoya-kun.

08:14.890 --> 08:15.590
Huh?

08:15.590 --> 08:17.010
It's very simple.

08:17.010 --> 08:22.520
Men of his age tend to show off to attract the attention of the woman they like.

08:22.520 --> 08:24.730
They don't confess how they really feel.

08:24.730 --> 08:25.730
Is that how it is?

08:25.730 --> 08:33.360
Yes, that usually indicates he's lying or hiding something, but he doesn't confess because of embarrassment.

08:33.360 --> 08:36.820
Lying or hiding something? Could that be?

08:36.820 --> 08:40.200
By the way, I'm hiding something from you, too.

08:40.200 --> 08:41.080
Huh?

08:41.080 --> 08:49.090
I truly want you to be happy. However, I can't say that to your face because it's embarrassing.

08:49.090 --> 08:50.590
Sensei...

08:52.800 --> 08:53.920
These are?

08:53.920 --> 08:56.840
These are rings that I had hoped to share with my special person...

08:56.840 --> 08:59.930
...but I lost my chance to give it to her.

08:59.930 --> 09:02.390
Please give one to Nagoya-kun.

09:02.390 --> 09:06.060
These things should bring happiness to you both.

09:06.060 --> 09:08.400
I-I can't accept such an important...!

09:08.400 --> 09:10.110
I don't mind.

09:10.110 --> 09:15.820
Keep this a secret from Nagoya-kun. It seems he doesn't like me.

09:15.820 --> 09:17.530
Sensei...

09:26.790 --> 09:30.380
Should a teacher really be sweet-talking his student?!

09:30.380 --> 09:31.090
Chiaki!

09:31.090 --> 09:32.960
I wasn't doing anything.

09:32.960 --> 09:36.050
I was just listening to Kusakabe-san's dilemma.

09:36.050 --> 09:38.930
T-That's right. We were just discussing...

09:40.600 --> 09:42.560
<i>Chiaki is mad...</i>

09:42.560 --> 09:46.060
Well, Kusakabe-san. Good luck.

09:47.900 --> 09:50.980
Girls don't like liars.

09:55.900 --> 09:57.950
Okay, this looks good.

09:59.370 --> 10:02.620
What did this have to do with History class?

10:02.620 --> 10:04.700
I can't go on anymore...

10:06.370 --> 10:11.290
Stop whining, clean up and meet inside the church!

10:11.290 --> 10:12.670
Monster...

10:13.630 --> 10:17.010
Why are you two always alone together?!

10:17.010 --> 10:19.550
What? Are you jealous?

10:19.550 --> 10:20.970
Is that a crime?!

10:20.970 --> 10:24.270
That's my business! We're not dating or anything!

10:24.270 --> 10:25.720
Then we should.

10:25.720 --> 10:26.520
What...?

10:26.520 --> 10:28.390
I love you, Maron.

10:28.390 --> 10:33.610
I've felt that way ever since I first saw you, and I've tried to show you, too.

10:33.610 --> 10:35.530
You're just saying that...

10:35.530 --> 10:38.070
Maron, do you hate me?

10:39.740 --> 10:40.910
Then...!

10:43.870 --> 10:46.410
But I can't trust you.

10:46.410 --> 10:50.460
You're always saying weird things...

10:50.460 --> 10:54.750
You're constantly flirting with other girls, too.

10:54.750 --> 10:56.760
It doesn't have to be me...

11:02.430 --> 11:03.350
No!

11:03.350 --> 11:04.600
It has to be you!

11:04.600 --> 11:06.140
No one else!

11:10.900 --> 11:11.650
That's...

11:24.740 --> 11:27.370
This is how I really feel.

11:40.050 --> 11:41.680
I can, right?

11:42.930 --> 11:48.350
I can really trust you, right?

11:48.350 --> 11:49.930
Yes.

11:53.480 --> 11:54.730
I'm so happy...

12:10.960 --> 12:13.790
You have all done well today.

12:13.790 --> 12:18.300
Sister says that she will now play the pipe organ for us.

12:18.300 --> 12:20.170
Everyone, listen closely.

12:20.710 --> 12:22.970
First P.E. and now music.

12:22.970 --> 12:25.010
When are we going to learn history?

12:26.100 --> 12:28.180
Hey, be quiet!

12:29.310 --> 12:31.680
She's kinda scary...

12:43.240 --> 12:44.990
It's such a beautiful sound...

12:44.990 --> 12:48.080
It's like it plays straight to the soul.

13:25.070 --> 13:26.160
Myst.

13:33.330 --> 13:35.290
Huh? Where is everyone?

13:42.130 --> 13:42.920
Sensei.

13:42.920 --> 13:48.050
Don't worry. Class is over and everyone went home.

13:48.970 --> 13:51.510
Now, right this way.

14:12.450 --> 14:13.620
Kusakabe Maron.

14:13.620 --> 14:19.920
Do you, in sickness and in health, promise to love Nagoya Chiaki as long as you both shall live?

14:23.050 --> 14:23.880
Yes!

14:24.170 --> 14:27.840
Nagoya Chiaki, do you feel the same way?

14:29.430 --> 14:30.340
YES!

14:32.390 --> 14:34.600
Now that you have promised before God...

14:34.600 --> 14:38.310
...don't make Kusakabe-san sad by holding secrets.

14:39.650 --> 14:40.940
Yeah...

14:40.940 --> 14:42.770
This is wonderful, isn't it?

14:42.770 --> 14:44.070
Yes!

15:05.300 --> 15:07.920
<i>It has to be you! No one else!</i>

15:19.270 --> 15:20.980
Maron-chan, are you all right?

15:20.980 --> 15:22.020
Oba-sama...

15:22.020 --> 15:23.860
Thank goodness. You're all right.

15:23.860 --> 15:25.520
Um... Is something wrong?

15:26.360 --> 15:27.400
Miyako!

15:27.400 --> 15:31.360
She fainted as soon as she came back from school...

15:31.360 --> 15:34.120
But at least you're all right.

15:34.120 --> 15:37.200
It seems like the entire class is in the same condition as Miyako...

15:37.200 --> 15:38.870
Everyone in our class?!

15:38.870 --> 15:41.420
Yes. I wonder what's happening?

15:41.420 --> 15:42.920
<i>What is going on?!</i>

15:42.920 --> 15:44.460
<i>It's as if a Demon...</i>

15:44.460 --> 15:46.880
<i>And if the entire class is in this condition...</i>

15:46.880 --> 15:47.750
<i>Could it be...?!</i>

15:48.760 --> 15:49.720
Maron-chan!

15:50.510 --> 15:53.720
Emergency! Emergency! Jeanne left in a rush!

15:53.720 --> 15:55.350
Okay! We're going, too!

15:55.350 --> 15:56.260
Roger!

15:56.850 --> 15:58.770
<i>Fin, lend me your power!</i>

15:58.770 --> 16:01.230
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

16:22.870 --> 16:24.830
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

16:24.830 --> 16:27.040
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

16:27.040 --> 16:28.840
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

16:35.510 --> 16:39.430
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

16:44.690 --> 16:47.610
Where are you?! Change everyone back to normal!

16:55.700 --> 16:56.990
Sister!

16:57.740 --> 16:59.830
What is this horrid feeling?!

17:00.290 --> 17:08.500
<i>Isn't it such a wonderful melody? It's your requiem.</i>

17:08.500 --> 17:11.260
It's flowing straight into my head!

17:12.010 --> 17:15.050
<i>Suffer! Cry!! Scream!!!</i>

17:15.050 --> 17:22.390
<i>Your torment will epitomize your death!</i>

17:25.600 --> 17:27.900
Are you all right, Jeanne?

17:27.900 --> 17:29.150
Sinbad...

17:30.020 --> 17:31.190
Don't touch me!

17:31.190 --> 17:32.990
I told you I will protect you.

17:32.990 --> 17:35.570
I refuse to have a servant of the Devil...!

17:35.900 --> 17:37.490
How obnoxious.

17:37.490 --> 17:39.200
Take them both out!

17:56.720 --> 18:01.930
<i>I will dispose of you both...</i>

18:11.320 --> 18:12.150
No way!

18:22.700 --> 18:24.410
Over here!

18:24.410 --> 18:27.080
<i>Then you shall be first!</i>

18:29.040 --> 18:30.830
What's the matter?! I'm over here!

18:42.260 --> 18:45.680
Wait! What are you doing?! The church is going to be ruined!

18:45.680 --> 18:46.480
Not my concern!

18:46.480 --> 18:49.140
<i>He's a quick one... Take this!</i>

19:04.120 --> 19:08.000
Do you finally understand that I'm not a servant of the Devil?

19:08.000 --> 19:10.670
Did you plan the whole thing?

19:10.670 --> 19:12.500
What if I did?

19:15.460 --> 19:17.170
Damn, he's pretty tough.

19:19.420 --> 19:20.430
What was that for?!

19:20.430 --> 19:22.640
I'm not going to let you destroy any more of this church.

19:22.640 --> 19:27.600
Only the Devil's servant would do anything he could to finish a job.

19:33.190 --> 19:34.230
This way, Sinbad!

19:35.860 --> 19:37.320
<i>You won't escape!</i>

19:38.740 --> 19:43.450
Move, Sinbad! I told you, I won't accept help from the Devil's servant!

19:43.450 --> 19:46.830
I don't care what you think of me. I'm going to protect you!

19:51.620 --> 19:52.670
Sinbad!

20:10.770 --> 20:12.480
<i>It can't be...</i>

20:12.480 --> 20:14.560
What are you doing?! Hurry!

20:20.400 --> 20:22.110
Who...are you...?

20:22.150 --> 20:23.110
<i>You're finished!</i>

20:25.280 --> 20:27.580
Snap out of it, Maron!

20:36.630 --> 20:37.880
<i>What the...?!</i>

20:37.880 --> 20:42.550
A Demon's power is useless against the sound of bells blessed by God!

20:48.810 --> 20:50.180
In the name of God...

20:52.520 --> 20:54.690
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:57.440 --> 21:00.190
I seal you here!

21:10.290 --> 21:11.790
<i>Checkmate!</i>

21:18.790 --> 21:20.170
<i>Collection completed!</i>

21:22.210 --> 21:25.970
Damn it! I was so close!

21:36.060 --> 21:36.650
Wait!

21:39.230 --> 21:41.860
Who...are you?

21:41.860 --> 21:44.240
You don't need to know.

21:44.240 --> 21:46.490
Who are you?!

21:46.490 --> 21:49.240
Is that all you have to say?

21:49.240 --> 21:50.990
WHO ARE YOU?!

22:28.610 --> 22:35.200
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.000 --> 22:44.670
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.260 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.850
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.010 --> 23:01.980
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.530 --> 23:14.580
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.780 --> 23:17.870
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.160 --> 23:21.080
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.540 --> 23:26.050
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.250 --> 23:30.090
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.340 --> 23:37.890
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:47.860 --> 23:50.900
Chiaki is Sinbad...

23:50.900 --> 23:55.990
I trusted you with all my heart... Was it all a lie?

23:55.990 --> 23:58.120
That's not it, Maron! Listen to me!

23:58.120 --> 23:58.910
I won't...

23:58.910 --> 24:00.040
Listen to me, Maron!!

24:00.040 --> 24:03.920
No... Don't hurt me anymore!

24:03.920 --> 24:07.130
I've had enough! I'm not going to trust anyone!

24:07.130 --> 24:11.840
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Confession of Separation! I'm Not Going to Trust Anyone!!

24:12.510 --> 24:14.890
Goodbye, Chiaki...
